WEBVTT

00:04.257 --> 00:07.307
<b>[SUBARU] So I'll just
get someone to kill me.</b>

00:07.347 --> 00:09.307
<b>[gasp]</b>

00:12.307 --> 00:15.607
<b>It really is
an endless desert.</b>

00:18.987 --> 00:21.697
<b>[sigh]</b>

00:23.737 --> 00:26.997
<b>[boom, scream]</b>

00:31.497 --> 00:33.667
<b>What the hell is that thing?</b>

00:33.707 --> 00:37.247
<b>[crash, yelp]</b>

00:39.047 --> 00:41.007
<b>[creak]</b>

00:41.047 --> 00:42.087
<b>Please no.</b>

00:42.137 --> 00:45.887
<b>[scream, squelch]</b>

00:53.897 --> 00:55.517
<b>[thud]</b>

01:02.567 --> 01:03.607
<b>What the hell?</b>

01:04.487 --> 01:07.697
<b>Come on,
give me a break, will you?</b>

01:08.617 --> 01:11.867
<b>Answer me already,
Subaru Natsuki!</b>

01:13.617 --> 01:16.667
<b>[scream]</b>

01:21.337 --> 01:22.547
<b>Someone!</b>

01:22.587 --> 01:23.587
<b>Someone help me.</b>

01:23.637 --> 01:24.837
<b>Please!</b>

01:27.847 --> 01:30.767
<b>[crackle]</b>

01:31.977 --> 01:34.097
<b>[gasp]</b>

01:35.227 --> 01:38.477
<b>[cough]</b>

01:46.067 --> 01:48.487
<b>[sand hissing]</b>

01:51.197 --> 01:53.457
<b>I'm underneath the desert?</b>

01:54.787 --> 01:57.917
<b>[squelch]</b>

02:06.257 --> 02:07.217
<b>Shit!</b>

02:07.257 --> 02:08.427
<b>Holy shit!</b>

02:08.467 --> 02:10.597
<b>What the hell?
What the hell?</b>

02:10.637 --> 02:13.727
<b>What the hell do
you want from me?</b>

02:13.767 --> 02:17.187
<b>[theme music]</b>

02:17.227 --> 02:24.527
<b>♪ ♪</b>

03:44.527 --> 03:47.027
<b>[pants, echoes]</b>

03:50.407 --> 03:52.737
<b>This would be the third one.</b>

03:52.777 --> 03:54.907
<b>[gulps]</b>

03:56.787 --> 03:58.327
<b>How long has it been?</b>

03:58.367 --> 03:59.747
<b>Three hours now.</b>

03:59.787 --> 04:01.327
<b>Maybe even four.</b>

04:01.377 --> 04:05.587
<b>[panting]</b>

04:11.137 --> 04:12.847
<b>[thud]</b>

04:16.767 --> 04:18.437
<b>Damn it!</b>

04:18.477 --> 04:22.147
<b>[water gurgles]</b>

04:37.367 --> 04:41.077
<b>[thumps]</b>

04:44.327 --> 04:45.627
<b>Screw you!</b>

04:45.667 --> 04:46.707
<b>Why?</b>

04:46.757 --> 04:49.127
<b>Why do you have to
be in my way?</b>

04:49.167 --> 04:52.507
<b>[sobs]</b>

04:52.547 --> 04:54.677
<b>What-- what the?</b>

04:54.717 --> 04:55.717
<b>Damn it.</b>

04:55.757 --> 04:59.017
<b>Stop screwing with me!</b>

05:02.017 --> 05:03.517
<b>Huh?</b>

05:09.897 --> 05:10.857
<b>Right.</b>

05:10.897 --> 05:14.067
<b>All that running.</b>

05:14.117 --> 05:16.447
<b>I ran and ran.</b>

05:20.747 --> 05:21.787
<b>I'm done with it.</b>

05:21.827 --> 05:25.537
<b>Yeah, I'll just kill you.</b>

05:25.577 --> 05:29.007
<b>[laughs]</b>

05:35.387 --> 05:41.517
<b>I have no idea which one of you
it was, but I'll kill you.</b>

05:41.557 --> 05:43.097
<b>I swear I'm going to kill you.</b>

05:43.137 --> 05:45.477
<b>I'll make sure you get
what you deserve.</b>

05:45.517 --> 05:49.357
<b>Kill you, kill you, kill you.</b>

05:49.397 --> 05:54.447
<b>Kill you, kill you,
kill you, kill you,</b>

05:54.487 --> 05:58.697
<b>kill you, kill you, kill you!</b>

05:58.737 --> 06:03.287
<b>Kill you, kill you, kill
you, kill you, kill you.</b>

06:03.327 --> 06:08.337
<b>Kill you, kill you, kill you,
kill you, kill you, kill you!</b>

06:08.377 --> 06:12.087
<b>[pants, cackles]</b>

06:21.637 --> 06:25.347
<b>[gasps]</b>

06:26.557 --> 06:30.227
<b>[retches]</b>

06:38.367 --> 06:41.787
<b>So then Shaula wasn't the one.</b>

06:45.537 --> 06:49.667
<b>Beatrice and Meili are only
kids so they'd be easy.</b>

06:49.707 --> 06:51.167
<b>Emilia seems to trust me.</b>

06:51.207 --> 06:53.167
<b>I could catch her by surprise.</b>

06:53.207 --> 06:55.047
<b>In that sense,
the most dangerous ones</b>

06:55.087 --> 06:57.007
<b>are Ram and Echidna.</b>

06:57.047 --> 06:59.217
<b>And then there's also Julius.</b>

06:59.257 --> 07:00.597
<b>It would save me
a lot of trouble</b>

07:00.637 --> 07:03.057
<b>if he'd just go die on his own.</b>

07:03.097 --> 07:06.437
<b>[sobs]</b>

07:26.037 --> 07:29.747
<b>[gags]</b>

07:46.347 --> 07:49.477
<b>Emilia and Beatrice are the
only ones I haven't seen yet.</b>

07:49.517 --> 07:51.477
<b>One of them
must be responsible.</b>

07:51.517 --> 07:53.317
<b>[crunch, gasp]</b>

07:55.817 --> 07:57.567
<b>Oh, it's you.</b>

07:57.607 --> 07:58.987
<b>[croak]</b>

07:59.027 --> 08:02.367
<b>[groans]</b>

08:02.407 --> 08:05.787
<b>[foreboding music]</b>

08:05.827 --> 08:10.787
<b>♪ ♪</b>

08:10.827 --> 08:12.577
<b>Stop following me around.</b>

08:12.627 --> 08:15.207
<b>I'm busy and I don't have time
to play with you!</b>

08:15.257 --> 08:16.957
<b>I still have to kill the rest.</b>

08:17.007 --> 08:19.337
<b>Anyone who's still alive
needs to die.</b>

08:20.967 --> 08:24.467
<b>If you're going to keep
getting in my way, then fine!</b>

08:24.507 --> 08:27.767
<b>[squelch]</b>

08:28.517 --> 08:32.267
<b>[cackle]</b>

08:39.567 --> 08:41.697
<b>Damn it!
Damn it!</b>

08:41.737 --> 08:42.697
<b>Damn it, damn it, damn it!</b>

08:42.737 --> 08:43.737
<b>What the hell?</b>

08:43.777 --> 08:44.987
<b>What the hell is all this?</b>

08:45.027 --> 08:46.997
<b>Why? What's your deal?</b>

08:47.037 --> 08:49.117
<b>You and all the others
in this damn place,</b>

08:49.157 --> 08:51.117
<b>the corpses of the ones
still breathing,</b>

08:51.167 --> 08:52.537
<b>what the hell's going
through your heads?</b>

08:52.577 --> 08:54.337
<b>What are you trying
to accomplish here?</b>

08:54.377 --> 08:55.747
<b>Let me make this
perfectly clear.</b>

08:55.787 --> 08:57.837
<b>I don't give a shit
about any of you.</b>

08:57.877 --> 08:59.377
<b>From the start,
the only thing you've done</b>

08:59.417 --> 09:01.087
<b>is shove your problems
down my throat!</b>

09:01.127 --> 09:02.587
<b>You're all too
up your own asses</b>

09:02.637 --> 09:03.887
<b>to even consider anyone else.</b>

09:03.927 --> 09:06.887
<b>But what about me?</b>

09:06.927 --> 09:10.267
<b>I've got plenty of my own damn
problems to deal with here.</b>

09:10.307 --> 09:13.767
<b>[sobs]</b>

09:18.027 --> 09:19.897
<b>Why does it have to be me?</b>

09:19.937 --> 09:22.357
<b>Why can't you all
just leave me alone?</b>

09:22.407 --> 09:24.117
<b>I want to be by myself.</b>

09:24.157 --> 09:25.117
<b>Come on.</b>

09:25.157 --> 09:27.027
<b>At least let me have that.</b>

09:28.287 --> 09:31.997
<b>[wails]</b>

09:32.747 --> 09:34.877
<b>[ground rumbles]</b>

09:34.917 --> 09:36.377
<b>[gasp]</b>

09:36.417 --> 09:37.747
<b>[squawk]</b>

09:37.787 --> 09:40.377
<b>What are you doing?</b>

09:43.127 --> 09:46.797
<b>[screams]</b>

09:46.847 --> 09:50.557
<b>[squawk, blood splashes]</b>

09:54.687 --> 09:58.187
<b>[panting]</b>

10:00.937 --> 10:05.447
<b>[gasps] Please, no more.</b>

10:05.487 --> 10:08.777
<b>No, I don't want to die!</b>

10:08.827 --> 10:10.997
<b>[thump, grunt]</b>

10:11.037 --> 10:14.917
<b>Listen!</b>

10:16.667 --> 10:18.377
<b>[thud]</b>

10:32.887 --> 10:35.597
<b>[crumble]</b>

10:35.637 --> 10:37.517
<b>What the hell?</b>

10:37.557 --> 10:39.227
<b>[footsteps]</b>

10:39.267 --> 10:41.227
<b>What do you want?</b>

10:41.277 --> 10:43.107
<b>Who the hell are you?</b>

10:45.397 --> 10:48.907
<b>Next time, I hope
you can figure it out.</b>

10:48.947 --> 10:50.027
<b>Hero.</b>

10:50.077 --> 10:53.747
<b>[splatter, whack]</b>

10:57.417 --> 10:58.917
<b>[EMILIA] Subaru.</b>

10:58.957 --> 11:00.537
<b>Hey, answer me, Subaru.</b>

11:00.587 --> 11:02.007
<b>Are you all right?</b>

11:02.047 --> 11:04.047
<b>Emilia.</b>

11:04.087 --> 11:06.047
<b>Oh, what a relief.</b>

11:06.087 --> 11:08.427
<b>I was really worried about you.</b>

11:09.927 --> 11:11.307
<b>Hm?</b>

11:12.717 --> 11:13.717
<b>Subaru?</b>

11:13.767 --> 11:14.927
<b>[gasp]</b>

11:14.977 --> 11:16.597
<b>Is there something wrong?</b>

11:18.807 --> 11:21.317
<b>He must still be
half asleep, I suppose.</b>

11:21.357 --> 11:23.227
<b>For someone who worries us
as much as you did,</b>

11:23.277 --> 11:24.897
<b>you sure are easygoing.</b>

11:24.937 --> 11:26.737
<b>[squawk]</b>

11:26.777 --> 11:28.367
<b>It's you.</b>

11:30.737 --> 11:33.327
<b>I'm unsatisfied with
this outcome, I suppose.</b>

11:33.367 --> 11:35.537
<b>After all, the ones who
found him lying on the ground</b>

11:35.577 --> 11:36.867
<b>were Emilia and Betty.</b>

11:36.907 --> 11:39.127
<b>[laugh] Now don't sulk.</b>

11:39.167 --> 11:40.497
<b>It's OK.</b>

11:40.537 --> 11:43.797
<b>Subaru and Patrasche
are really close, is all.</b>

11:46.757 --> 11:50.547
<b>Hey, Subaru, you're absolutely
sure you're feeling all right?</b>

11:50.597 --> 11:52.557
<b>Yeah, I'm doing totally fine.</b>

11:52.597 --> 11:54.057
<b>No problemo.</b>

11:54.097 --> 11:56.347
<b>I guess all the exhaustion
just caught up to me.</b>

11:56.387 --> 11:59.137
<b>It's not weird for tired
people to pass out, you know.</b>

11:59.187 --> 12:00.767
<b>Right.</b>

12:00.807 --> 12:03.437
<b>But when you feel tired,
you should tell us, honestly.</b>

12:03.477 --> 12:05.817
<b>It's not good to push
yourself so hard.</b>

12:09.317 --> 12:11.277
<b>[SUBARU] I know
I'm taking a big risk here,</b>

12:11.317 --> 12:14.737
<b>but this time I'm not going to
tell them about my memory loss.</b>

12:14.777 --> 12:16.577
<b>I'm going to find out
if it's connected</b>

12:16.617 --> 12:19.997
<b>to the reason I'm getting
killed over and over again.</b>

12:20.037 --> 12:21.457
<b>Although, frankly,
while I could</b>

12:21.497 --> 12:23.037
<b>see killing someone
over information</b>

12:23.087 --> 12:25.087
<b>you don't want them
to know or remember,</b>

12:25.127 --> 12:27.297
<b>I'm finding it a lot harder
to think of a reason anyone</b>

12:27.337 --> 12:29.427
<b>would kill over something
being forgotten.</b>

12:29.467 --> 12:30.717
<b>[pop]</b>

12:30.757 --> 12:31.677
<b>Huh?</b>

12:32.637 --> 12:34.967
<b>Subaru, you've got that
furrowed brow</b>

12:35.007 --> 12:36.927
<b>on your face again.</b>

12:38.347 --> 12:40.557
<b>What did I even do
to make her get so comfortable</b>

12:40.597 --> 12:42.307
<b>and close with me anyway?</b>

12:44.897 --> 12:49.107
<b>I wasn't able to find either
of their bodies before, but--</b>

12:49.147 --> 12:52.697
<b>[KILLER] Next time,
I hope you can figure it out.</b>

12:52.737 --> 12:54.827
<b>Hero.</b>

12:54.867 --> 12:57.617
<b>[SUBARU] That voice didn't
belong to one of them.</b>

12:57.657 --> 12:59.787
<b>In fact, no one in this
group really sounds--</b>

12:59.827 --> 13:01.367
<b>[RAM] Baresu.</b>

13:03.167 --> 13:06.037
<b>Stop staring into space
and help me fetch some water.</b>

13:06.087 --> 13:07.047
<b>Oh, sure.</b>

13:07.087 --> 13:08.377
<b>Sorry.</b>

13:08.417 --> 13:10.257
<b>I hear you were
sleeping in the archive.</b>

13:10.297 --> 13:13.047
<b>You've got to stop trying
such stupid things.</b>

13:13.087 --> 13:15.007
<b>You'll just cause trouble
for everyone.</b>

13:15.047 --> 13:16.257
<b>You're right.</b>

13:16.307 --> 13:17.677
<b>I'll be careful.</b>

13:17.717 --> 13:20.387
<b>I apologize
for making you worry too.</b>

13:20.427 --> 13:21.847
<b>You think I would be worried?</b>

13:21.887 --> 13:23.347
<b>About what?
- I don't know.</b>

13:23.397 --> 13:24.727
<b>I guess for my safety.</b>

13:24.767 --> 13:25.727
<b>Ha!</b>

13:25.767 --> 13:27.517
<b>Good morning, Master.</b>

13:27.567 --> 13:29.987
<b>You got some quality
Z's last night?</b>

13:30.027 --> 13:32.397
<b>[gasp]</b>

13:32.447 --> 13:33.737
<b>[SHAULA] Oh, me.</b>

13:33.777 --> 13:34.867
<b>I slept like a rock.</b>

13:34.907 --> 13:36.157
<b>Thanks for asking.</b>

13:36.197 --> 13:38.077
<b>I had a dream
about the past, actually.</b>

13:38.117 --> 13:39.997
<b>Yeah, it was you and me
and my mom.</b>

13:40.037 --> 13:41.367
<b>And also--</b>

13:41.407 --> 13:42.747
<b>OK, OK, I get it.</b>

13:42.787 --> 13:44.497
<b>You can tell me
all about it later, OK?</b>

13:44.537 --> 13:47.127
<b>Anyway, did you notice
anything about me</b>

13:47.167 --> 13:49.087
<b>when you saw me this morning?</b>

13:49.127 --> 13:51.297
<b>About this morning's Master?</b>

13:51.337 --> 13:53.547
<b>Like usual, you were sexy AF.</b>

13:53.587 --> 13:56.047
<b>I've waited 400 years
for you to propose.</b>

13:56.097 --> 13:58.217
<b>You've got
the patience of a saint.</b>

13:58.257 --> 14:00.217
<b>If you didn't notice
anything, it's all good.</b>

14:00.267 --> 14:01.767
<b>You sure?
[door clacks]</b>

14:01.807 --> 14:03.057
<b>Huh?</b>

14:11.107 --> 14:13.777
<b>[sigh]</b>

14:14.487 --> 14:16.527
<b>Shaula, I need a favor.</b>

14:16.567 --> 14:17.527
<b>Huh?</b>

14:17.577 --> 14:19.027
<b>What is it?</b>

14:19.077 --> 14:20.367
<b>[squeak]</b>

14:20.407 --> 14:21.747
<b>[SUBARU] Julius.</b>

14:23.157 --> 14:26.207
<b>I want to talk to you about
what happened last night.</b>

14:26.247 --> 14:28.087
<b>Just the two of us, you know.</b>

14:31.627 --> 14:33.217
<b>[JULIUS] About last night?</b>

14:34.627 --> 14:37.847
<b>I assumed that that
conversation was long over.</b>

14:37.887 --> 14:39.557
<b>Do you disagree with that?</b>

14:39.597 --> 14:40.967
<b>Yeah, I sure do.</b>

14:41.007 --> 14:42.637
<b>I wasn't satisfied
with the outcome</b>

14:42.677 --> 14:44.517
<b>of our chat in the slightest.</b>

14:48.057 --> 14:50.567
<b>Satisfied, eh?</b>

14:50.607 --> 14:51.567
<b>I see.</b>

14:51.607 --> 14:53.687
<b>That's very like you.</b>

14:53.737 --> 14:56.737
<b>However, do you not feel
that's a bit too selfish?</b>

14:56.777 --> 14:58.117
<b>You don't seem
to be satisfied</b>

14:58.157 --> 14:59.657
<b>with how it ended either.</b>

14:59.697 --> 15:01.237
<b>Look, we're the same.</b>

15:01.277 --> 15:03.707
<b>Both holding on to something
that pisses us off non-stop.</b>

15:03.747 --> 15:05.497
<b>And you expect me
to just live with it?</b>

15:05.537 --> 15:07.117
<b>Like hell I can.</b>

15:07.167 --> 15:09.037
<b>Well, then,
what other choices</b>

15:09.087 --> 15:10.957
<b>do we have in your mind?</b>

15:10.997 --> 15:14.257
<b>My feelings are exactly what
I conveyed to you last night.</b>

15:14.297 --> 15:17.127
<b>Beyond that,
I have nothing left to say.</b>

15:17.177 --> 15:21.137
<b>Your secret with Ms. Anastasia,
or rather, Echidna,</b>

15:21.177 --> 15:24.517
<b>was one that I was
not trusted to be privy to.</b>

15:24.557 --> 15:27.187
<b>[SUBARU] The secret
between me and Echidna.</b>

15:27.227 --> 15:30.977
<b>You meant no harm in keeping
it from me, I understand.</b>

15:31.017 --> 15:34.527
<b>And I've spoken with Echidna,
though not nearly enough.</b>

15:34.567 --> 15:38.317
<b>I know she can be trusted,
or that there</b>

15:38.357 --> 15:40.827
<b>is no option but to trust her.</b>

15:40.867 --> 15:43.237
<b>If I hope to save
Ms. Anastasia,</b>

15:43.287 --> 15:46.287
<b>then my only option is
to bet on that being true.</b>

15:48.367 --> 15:50.707
<b>And even if getting her back</b>

15:50.747 --> 15:52.337
<b>doesn't mean that
she'll be able to remember</b>

15:52.377 --> 15:54.167
<b>who I am anymore.</b>

15:54.877 --> 15:56.797
<b>What does that mean?</b>

15:57.927 --> 15:59.587
<b>Enough.</b>

15:59.637 --> 16:01.217
<b>I beg you,
please don't make me feel</b>

16:01.257 --> 16:03.427
<b>any more pathetic
in your presence.</b>

16:07.517 --> 16:09.937
<b>When you brought up
what happened last night,</b>

16:09.977 --> 16:11.477
<b>it frightened me a bit.</b>

16:11.517 --> 16:13.567
<b>I didn't know what I would do
if you had ended up</b>

16:13.607 --> 16:16.067
<b>apologizing to me instead.</b>

16:16.107 --> 16:17.567
<b>What do you mean?</b>

16:17.607 --> 16:19.487
<b>Don't think I follow.</b>

16:19.527 --> 16:22.827
<b>If you had, well,
I can't help but wonder</b>

16:22.867 --> 16:24.907
<b>how I would have responded.</b>

16:24.947 --> 16:28.117
<b>However, I'll never know
for sure, I suppose.</b>

16:32.287 --> 16:35.337
<b>[door clacks]</b>

16:37.257 --> 16:40.377
<b>[sighs]</b>

16:40.837 --> 16:43.297
<b>[SHAULA grunts]</b>

16:43.347 --> 16:44.847
<b>You sure you're cool leaving</b>

16:44.887 --> 16:46.807
<b>things like that, Master?</b>

16:46.847 --> 16:48.267
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:48.307 --> 16:49.977
<b>I don't think Julius had
anything to do</b>

16:50.017 --> 16:52.097
<b>with what happened to me
in the archive.</b>

16:52.147 --> 16:54.727
<b>Although now he's even
more suspicious</b>

16:54.767 --> 16:56.267
<b>of who I was yesterday.</b>

16:56.317 --> 16:59.107
<b>Yeah, I don't really get it,
but was I able to be</b>

16:59.147 --> 17:00.947
<b>at least a teeny bit useful?</b>

17:00.987 --> 17:03.067
<b>Yeah, you totally nailed it.</b>

17:03.117 --> 17:05.197
<b>Because I knew I had
you there to support me,</b>

17:05.237 --> 17:07.577
<b>I was able to confront
Julius without any fear.</b>

17:07.617 --> 17:11.037
<b>[giggle] That makes me
so happy to hear.</b>

17:11.077 --> 17:14.707
<b>So if that's the case,
listen, Master.</b>

17:14.747 --> 17:16.917
<b>I deserve a little reward,
don't you think?</b>

17:16.957 --> 17:18.247
<b>And a big hug would be perfect.</b>

17:18.297 --> 17:19.337
<b>Not happening.</b>

17:19.377 --> 17:21.547
<b>[yelp]
You poopyhead meanie jerk!</b>

17:21.587 --> 17:23.547
<b>You told me you'd give me
any reward I wanted,</b>

17:23.587 --> 17:25.047
<b>as long as it wasn't
way out of bounds.</b>

17:25.097 --> 17:26.467
<b>How can you go back
on your word?</b>

17:26.507 --> 17:27.967
<b>I didn't.</b>

17:28.017 --> 17:29.387
<b>You just don't seem to
understand what a boundary is.</b>

17:29.427 --> 17:31.057
<b>[groans]</b>

17:31.097 --> 17:32.387
<b>Come on.</b>

17:32.437 --> 17:33.767
<b>Who's after you?</b>

17:33.807 --> 17:35.307
<b>And what did you do
to put a target on your back</b>

17:35.357 --> 17:38.897
<b>like this, Subaru Natsuki?</b>

17:38.937 --> 17:40.987
<b>I'm not sure
where to go from here.</b>

17:41.027 --> 17:43.277
<b>I'm starting to think
I should go and ask Patrasche.</b>

17:43.317 --> 17:44.277
<b>Huh?</b>

17:44.317 --> 17:46.067
<b>The land dragon, what?</b>

17:46.117 --> 17:47.537
<b>She keeps giving me
the stink eye.</b>

17:47.577 --> 17:48.537
<b>I don't like her.</b>

17:48.577 --> 17:49.907
<b>Hey, stop it.</b>

17:49.947 --> 17:51.577
<b>I won't let you badmouth
Patrasche like that.</b>

17:51.617 --> 17:54.117
<b>Even if it was acceptable
to talk smack about everyone,</b>

17:54.167 --> 17:55.917
<b>I wouldn't let anyone
say a single bad thing</b>

17:55.957 --> 17:57.377
<b>about Patrasche.</b>

17:57.417 --> 17:58.957
<b>Whoa, there, Master.</b>

17:58.997 --> 18:01.337
<b>Just how badly does that
land dragon have you whipped?</b>

18:01.377 --> 18:05.137
<b>On that note, this little
meeting of ours is adjourned.</b>

18:05.177 --> 18:06.257
<b>I'll see you around.</b>

18:06.297 --> 18:07.757
<b>Aah!</b>

18:07.807 --> 18:10.177
<b>So you're just going to leave
without rewarding me?</b>

18:10.217 --> 18:12.477
<b>But that's not enough
to make me lose heart.</b>

18:12.517 --> 18:14.727
<b>I strive to be a woman
of convenience.</b>

18:14.767 --> 18:17.477
<b>In fact, that is my sole
reason for living.</b>

18:19.397 --> 18:21.397
<b>That's a whole lot
to offer someone.</b>

18:21.437 --> 18:24.027
<b>What's so special
about Subaru Natsuki?</b>

18:24.067 --> 18:25.357
<b>Huh?</b>

18:25.407 --> 18:26.317
<b>You OK?</b>

18:26.367 --> 18:28.277
<b>Oh, damn it.</b>

18:31.327 --> 18:32.867
<b>[gasp]</b>

18:33.867 --> 18:35.747
<b>You don't have
to be convenient.</b>

18:35.787 --> 18:37.957
<b>I don't want you
worrying about all that.</b>

18:37.997 --> 18:38.957
<b>It's my bad.</b>

18:38.997 --> 18:40.627
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

18:42.297 --> 18:43.547
<b>Master.</b>

18:47.297 --> 18:49.757
<b>Having you there
was a big help to me.</b>

18:49.807 --> 18:51.217
<b>It's that simple.</b>

18:53.217 --> 18:54.677
<b>Master.</b>

18:55.727 --> 18:58.727
<b>You're finally--
at last you're ready to--</b>

18:59.607 --> 19:02.027
<b>--give me
all your sweet loving!</b>

19:02.067 --> 19:04.437
<b>Hey, boundaries, woman!</b>

19:04.487 --> 19:07.147
<b>[water drips]</b>

19:16.247 --> 19:18.917
<b>What if the way they've all
been acting isn't genuine?</b>

19:18.957 --> 19:20.337
<b>I have no idea
what the heck</b>

19:20.377 --> 19:22.627
<b>I'm supposed to believe
anymore.</b>

19:22.667 --> 19:25.297
<b>[sigh]</b>

19:25.337 --> 19:28.507
<b>Guess the only one I can
really trust is Patrasche then.</b>

19:30.297 --> 19:33.177
<b>Maybe I'd be happier
if I left to live in a paradise</b>

19:33.217 --> 19:35.347
<b>where us two could live
peacefully together.</b>

19:35.387 --> 19:37.347
<b>[MEILI] Uh-oh, I heard that.</b>

19:37.387 --> 19:38.307
<b>[yelps]</b>

19:38.347 --> 19:40.857
<b>[giggle] I get it.</b>

19:40.897 --> 19:43.647
<b>You want to take Patrasche
and run away from here.</b>

19:43.687 --> 19:46.187
<b>If you let Beatrice
and Emilia hear you say that,</b>

19:46.237 --> 19:47.697
<b>they would start
crying for sure.</b>

19:47.737 --> 19:49.867
<b>Oh, come on,
it was just a crappy joke.</b>

19:49.907 --> 19:52.157
<b>Forget you ever heard it,
will you?</b>

19:52.197 --> 19:53.697
<b>Yeah, sure.</b>

19:53.737 --> 19:56.787
<b>You know, even if that
is how you honestly feel,</b>

19:56.827 --> 19:58.497
<b>I won't laugh
at you or anything.</b>

19:58.537 --> 20:00.877
<b>If anyone could understand it,
it's me.</b>

20:00.917 --> 20:03.297
<b>I've lived with mabeasts
all my life, remember?</b>

20:03.337 --> 20:05.297
<b>Yeah, of course, mabeasts.</b>

20:05.337 --> 20:08.047
<b>So kind of like you
were raised by wolves?</b>

20:08.087 --> 20:09.467
<b>[giggle]</b>

20:09.507 --> 20:12.177
<b>You said that yesterday, too.</b>

20:12.217 --> 20:14.557
<b>My mom was incredibly strict.</b>

20:14.597 --> 20:17.267
<b>On top of that, Elsa, who
was with me most of the time,</b>

20:17.307 --> 20:18.887
<b>didn't do very much.</b>

20:18.937 --> 20:21.557
<b>So there was a lot I had to
take care of by myself y'know.</b>

20:21.607 --> 20:23.267
<b>OK, wait, wait, wait.</b>

20:23.317 --> 20:25.647
<b>The more you talk, the more my
brain turns into Swiss cheese.</b>

20:25.687 --> 20:26.987
<b>Look, I'm super busy right now.</b>

20:27.027 --> 20:28.737
<b>Go play with Shaula
or something.</b>

20:28.777 --> 20:30.697
<b>The half-naked girl?</b>

20:30.737 --> 20:33.907
<b>I don't mind doing that, but I
do have some business with you</b>

20:33.947 --> 20:35.407
<b>at the moment.</b>

20:35.447 --> 20:37.077
<b>What business?</b>

20:43.377 --> 20:45.747
<b>[MEILI slurps]</b>

20:45.797 --> 20:48.047
<b>You said something
to me yesterday,</b>

20:48.087 --> 20:51.297
<b>and it got me thinking, how
seriously should I take that?</b>

20:51.337 --> 20:53.677
<b>[eerie tone]</b>

20:55.717 --> 20:57.887
<b>[grunt]</b>

21:01.557 --> 21:03.107
<b>What is this?</b>

21:06.477 --> 21:09.777
<b>[ominous music]</b>

21:09.817 --> 21:12.487
<b>♪ ♪</b>

21:12.527 --> 21:14.867
<b>No, but why?</b>

21:14.907 --> 21:16.277
<b>No way.
It's not.</b>

21:16.327 --> 21:17.287
<b>It can't.</b>

21:17.327 --> 21:19.077
<b>Please Meili.</b>

21:20.327 --> 21:22.367
<b>Hey, Meili!</b>

21:22.417 --> 21:24.997
<b>Meili, Meili!</b>

21:25.037 --> 21:26.247
<b>Damn it.</b>

21:28.587 --> 21:30.547
<b>Damn it, damn it.</b>

21:35.927 --> 21:37.177
<b>No way.</b>

21:41.097 --> 21:42.347
<b>I killed her.</b>

21:43.847 --> 21:46.857
<b>But why would I do that?</b>

21:52.067 --> 21:55.567
<b>[sleeves rustle, gasp]</b>

21:57.827 --> 22:00.827
<b>[hyperventilates]</b>

22:02.457 --> 22:05.997
<b>SUBARU NATSUKI WAS HERE</b>

22:06.837 --> 22:09.917
<b>EMPTY SHELL</b>

22:13.547 --> 22:17.097
<b>[singing in Japanese]</b>

22:17.137 --> 22:18.887
<b>♪ ♪</b>
